                        Vistos
                    </span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/personal/verpronto"
                    class="flex-shrink-0 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 font-medium text-gray-700 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 hover:scale-105">
                        <span class="flex items-center whitespace-nowrap">
